[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_EKpFlIxa2pRbtZAkrEynTmpY","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"54875","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,220p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md","name":"pushbutton.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<pushbutton />`\n\nPushbuttons a common type of switch normally open momentary switch. They are commonly used as a reset or pairing button.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    <pushbutton\n      name=\"SW1\"\n      footprint=\"pushbutton\"\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `name`, `footprint`, `connections`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [PushButtonProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#pushbuttonprops-pushbutton)\n- Source: [lib/components/push-button.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/push-button.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/pushbutton.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/pushbutton.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e8ead-3fdb-77d3-a78e-cef14bcae7bf","turnId":"019e8ead-3fee-7a90-8564-fe53b81ce8f4","completedAtMs":1780510269363}}
